      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "RenektonPreExecute",
        "name": "冷酷捕猎",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "雷克顿两次挥击目标，对其造成中等水平物理伤害并晕眩其0.75秒。如果雷克顿有50点以上怒气，他会三次挥击目标，摧毁目标身上的伤害护盾，对其造成高额物理伤害，并晕眩其1.5秒。",
        "bodyHtml": "雷克顿的下次攻击会进行两次打击，造成0.75秒<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">晕眩</span>和共计<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(10/40/70/100/130 + (150% 攻击力))物理伤害</span>。命中一名英雄会生成额外的<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">10怒气</span>。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">怒气加成</span>：雷克顿转而进行三次打击，摧毁<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">护盾</span>然后造成<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(15/60/105/150/195 + (225% 攻击力))物理伤害</span>和1.5秒<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">晕眩</span>。不会生成任何<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">怒气</span>。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">所有攻击都会各自施加攻击特效。</span><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">不会打破野怪身上的护盾。</span>",
        "iconFile": "RenektonPreExecute.png",
