      "E": {
        "slot": "E",
        "id": "RenektonSliceAndDice",
        "name": "横冲直撞",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "雷克顿冲向前方，对沿途的敌人造成伤害。如果雷克顿有50点以上怒气，就会造成额外伤害，并减少沿途敌人的护甲值。",
        "bodyHtml": "雷克顿进行冲刺，造成<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(40/70/100/130/160 + (90% 额外攻击力))物理伤害</span>。他每命中一名非英雄单位就会生成<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">2怒气</span>，每命中一位英雄就会生成<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">10怒气</span>。如果至少命中一名敌人，那么雷克顿就能在4秒内<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">再次施放</span>这个技能一次。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">怒气加成</span>：<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">再次施放</span>的冲刺转而造成<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(70/115/160/205/250 + (135% 额外攻击力))物理伤害</span>并造成持续4秒的<span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">25/27.5/30/32.5/35%护甲</span>削减。不会生成<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">怒气</span>。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">每次施放最多获得<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">30 怒气</span>。</span>",
