        "bodyHtml": "雷克顿用黑暗能量笼罩自身，持续15秒，获得<span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">300/500/700最大生命值</span>和<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">20怒气</span>。在激活时，他每秒造成<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/150/240 + (10% 法术强度) + (10% 额外攻击力))魔法伤害</span>并获得<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">5怒气</span>。",
